From b101837b27cfdc95cad4fb65e4a63388189d7f68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 06 Jan 2021 14:10:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-0] bitops: introduce dedicated header

As a preparation for the Gaudi HBM code addition, we need to introduce
the ffs() function for finding set bits.
This already gives a rationale for a dedicated bitops header.
Introduce such a header and move all the relevant bit macros to the new
header.
This also remove the duplication of the EXTRACT_BITS() macro.

Change-Id: If5b3c4c302c4683a3abd8e45b8544c341d112332
Signed-off-by: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
